	| File Name                      | Document_3.txt     |
	| File Name Link                 | false              |
	| File Size                      | 1KB                |
	| Attached                       | LFA Customer1      |
	| Does Not Contain Personal Data | false              |
	And the attachment with the keyword "Document_3.txt" should have the actions link visible

Scenario: Upload large files to different tickets
	Users should be able to upload multiple large attachments to different tickets using the large file uploader

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create a user with the following parameters
	| Screen Name   | lfa.customer1                       |
	| Email Address | lfa.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | LFA                                 |
	| Last Name     | Customer1                           |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
